th: 128px;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">1</p> </td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px; width: 104px;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">2</p> </td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px; width: 91px;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">3</p> </td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px; width: 55.0312px;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">4</p> </td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px; width: 76px;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">5</p> </td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px; width: 89px;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">6</p> </td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px; width: 113px;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">7</p> </td> </tr> <tr class="TableGrid-R" style="height: 52px;"><td class="TableGrid-C" style="border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px; width: 391px;">I can talk about my problems with my friends.</td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px; width: 128px;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">1</p> </td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px; width: 104px;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">2</p> </td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px; width: 91px;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">3</p> </td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; height: 52px