ibrary.illinois.edu/latex?latex=XG1hdGhiZntcU2lnbWF9KHgg4oCTIFxiYXJ7eH0pPTA&amp;fg=000000&amp;svg=1&amp;isBase64=1" alt="\mathbf{\Sigma}(x – \bar{x})=0" title="\mathbf{\Sigma}(x – \bar{x})=0" class="latex mathjax" /></strong></td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="background-color: #e7e6e6; border: 0.5pt solid windowtext; width: 165.266px;"><p style="text-align: center;"><strong><img src="https://mathjax.library.illinois.edu/latex?latex=XG1hdGhiZntcU2lnbWF9KHgg4oCTXGJhcnt4fSleMj04NA&amp;fg=000000&amp;svg=1&amp;isBase64=1" alt="\mathbf{\Sigma}(x –\bar{x})^2=84" title="\mathbf{\Sigma}(x –\bar{x})^2=84" class="latex mathjax" /></strong></p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p class="import-Normal">Table 7.3 shows the work for finding the sum of squares using the computational formula.&nbsp;<em><br style="clear: both;" /></em></p> <table><caption>Table 7.3. Work for Finding Sum of Squares Using the Computational Formula</caption> <thead><tr class="shaded"><th class="TableGrid-C" style="border: 0.5pt solid windowtext;" scope="col"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;"><strong>Client</strong></p> </th> <th class="TableGrid-C" style="border: 0.5pt solid windowtext;" scope="col"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;"><strong><img src="https://mathjax.library.illinois.edu/latex?latex=eA&amp;fg=000000&amp;svg=1&amp;isBase64=1" alt="x" title="x" class="latex mathjax" /></strong></p> </th> <th class="TableGrid-C" style="border: 0.5pt solid windowtext;" scope="col"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;"><strong><img src="https://mathjax.library.illinois.edu/latex?latex=eF4y&amp;fg=000000&amp;svg=1&amp;isBase64=1" alt="x^2" title="x^2" class="latex mathjax" /></strong></p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr class="TableGrid-R"><td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: solid windowtext 0.5pt;"><p class="import-Normal" style="text-align: center;">1</p> </td> <td class="TableGrid-C" style="vertical-align: middle; border: solid w